	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030090"},
		line=903,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"We finish our meal in a little under two hours and exit Miyoshi together.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks for showing me a good time.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I really enjoyed being able to hear your point of view on things.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Was the food to your liking?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It lived up to all my expectations.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Glad to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll see you to the occupation zone.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No need. I've already got a ride.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Elsa glances down the street at a uniformed man stepping out of a car.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"It's Rochel.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right, he's a soldier, too.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You two get along pretty well, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Well enough, I suppose.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"That said, it doesn't feel like we're all that close.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"He often comes to talk to me, but I don't think I've ever started a conversation with him.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Well, maybe that's just how friends are.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Heya, Soujin. Good evening.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Is this the first time we've run into each other outside school?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, sure looks like it.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"He shows me his usual friendly smile.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Senior Colonel Elsa, was your meal a pleasant one?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It was quite fine.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I envy you. I've always wanted to dine here at least once, but you know how it is.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“It's not the most approachable establishment for us Republicans.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“That said, I sure didn't expect the two of you to be close enough to share a meal together.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What're you implying?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We were simply socializing as two fellow members of the student council.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Elsa tells him off, clearly displeased.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"By the look of things, their relationship is less than favorable.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun, thank you for today. I'll see you at school tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'll be starting our preparations for the upcoming field trip, so let's give it our all.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"We exchange pleasantries, and Elsa and Rochel take their leave.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"After a while, I head home with Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She sure found out about Kanami real quickly.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just goes to show how capable she can be.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why are you complimenting her? Jeez.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"She lightly checks me with her shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The problem is that Elsa is getting suspicious of us.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She seems to think that warriors would never fight for a false Empress because it would go against our fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She's totally seen through us, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Our only option is to persuade her that taking down Okonogi matters more to us than anything else, and that Empress Hisui can wait until afterwards.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's all over for us the minute she figures out our true intentions, though.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"We intend to betray Elsa and fight against the Republic at the eleventh hour.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"If she figures that out beforehand, she'll wipe us all out the moment we start our uprising.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm also worried about Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If her identity is discovered, she'll be arrested for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The last thing Elsa needs is a second Empress popping up, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Hotori looks up at the sky and lets out a big sigh.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All this is starting to hurt my head.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm definitely not cut out for all this scheming.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Me neither. It's so much easier to just swing a blade.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Spoken like a true warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"A black car pulls up right beside us.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"We immediately put up our guards as the window rolls open.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hey there, pretty lady. Where're you headed?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, it's just you, Shino. What are you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Elsa told me she was going to Miyoshi.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I wanted to crash your little ≪party,≫ but man, the governor-general just went on and on.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oops, shouldn't be bad-mouthing our clients.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Shino playfully sticks out her tongue.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If it's cool with you, mind telling me what y'all talked about?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you have the time for that?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm the one who chatted you up. Course I've got the time.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"We sit down on a bench by the side of the road and summarize the events of tonight.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, whipping out a gun in the middle of Miyoshi? Elsa sure is an ≪eccentric≫ one.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Eck-sen...?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It means she's a real mischief-maker.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Shino takes a sip of her canned coffee.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"It's a drink that was introduced to the Empire after the war.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Hotori and I went with the safe choice of green tea.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“So, d'you think you can get along with Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're on different sides, but I don't think she's a bad person.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“As an old friend of hers, I'm glad to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You've known Elsa ever since you were living in the Republic, right?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Shino shows us her usual smirk.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Lemme tell you an old story.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It just might give you the upper hand in dealing with her.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Shino crosses her legs and leans back all the way against the bench we're sitting on.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"She even folds her hands behind her head for good measure.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Any ordinary girl would be called unladylike for striking such a pose, but when Shino does it, it somehow looks just right.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Elsa's the daughter of the Republic's governor-general, Warren Valentine, right? Well, as if there's anyone who\ndoesn't know that.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Warren's sort of a real big deal back in the Republic. He's a veteran who has a long list of exploits from every corner of the world.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You could say he's the living embodiment of the\nRepublic's quest for world domination.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And making war isn't all he's good at, mind you. He might be even better at making dough.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Can you be more specific?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Like, he'll do a little weapons testing for the arms industry here, carry out a few needless bombings to use up old munitions there.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And each time, fat stacks find their way right into his pockets.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Naturally, he then shares the wealth with his politician friends to raise his own standing.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Wouldn't be wrong to say that his current position is built on people's lives.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Makes me sick to the stomach.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Once upon a time, there was a little girl who thought the exact same thing.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“She still does, in fact. But back in the day, Elsa was even more of an idealist.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“She seriously believed the Republic fought its wars to liberate the people of the world from tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“But, you know, she couldn't stay a child forever.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“One day, she finally realized that the Republic's wars were nothing more than sleazy schemes to line the pockets of the rich and powerful.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And with that came the realization that all the clothes she was wearing, all the food she was eating, all the education she was receiving─”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Everything that made her who she is was bought and paid for by Warren's blood money.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Were you close with Elsa back then?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sure was. We were roommates, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“She threw up everything she ate and didn't sleep for three straight days.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It was like she was trying to spit out all of Warren's blood inside of her.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Ah, so she was betrayed by what she believed in.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The Imperial people are the ones currently putting the food on Warren's table, so it's not hard for me to imagine\nElsa's anguish at being that man's daughter.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“What makes Elsa so special, though, is that she never strayed from her ideals, even after she learned the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“How do you think she managed that?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Shino asks, wagging her finger in front of my face.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She wanted to try and set her father straight?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She gave up trying to do anything about it?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Beats me.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gah...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The two of us facepalm in unison.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, knowing what she's like, I'm sure she thought looong and hard about it.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I think back to what Elsa said in Miyoshi.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have no hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I fight for the sake of all those who suffer under tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Even knowing what Warren is doing, Elsa still managed to say that.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Is she serious, or is she just putting up an act?",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Anyway, that girl always thinks things through and knows what she's doing.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“So I guess what I'm trying to say is...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Shino gives Hotori and me a meaningful look.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It'd be nice if you'd get along with her.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We get along just fine. Our dinner today was very amicable.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“No, no, no, that's not what I'm getting at.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm talking about the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Shino shows me a smile, her eyes never leaving mine.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"She might have seen through our intentions to betray Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You know, I told Elsa the same thing about you guys. I only joined Operation Bellflower because I trust everyone involved.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm looking forward to a conclusion where ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"everyone",
{"/font"},
" lives happily ever after.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll keep it in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I have no hope of getting a lie past Shino.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"All I can do is respond with as few words as possible to try and prevent her from figuring us out.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Alrighty then, onto business!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Shino makes a big show of dusting off her lap.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That was just the prelude?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“C'mon, can't you let me work up a little courage?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“O-Oh, sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Hotori fumbles around for an apology as Shino pouts in the background.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“See, I've got an important favor to ask Natsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We have a bigshot client who's got their own reasons, but long story short, they really want her to put on a concert.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I don't mind, but when?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah... it's gonna have to be within the next week or two.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's awfully short notice...”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's why I'm calling in this favor!”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Who was it again that hooked you up with that construction van when you were breaking into the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Help me out with this and we'll call it even.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"The agency Natsumi belongs to is a subsidiary of the Kurushima Group.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"That is to say, if Shino seriously wanted anything out of her, Natsumi wouldn't be in any position to refuse.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"She's already showing plenty of consideration to treat this as a favor between friends.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If you put it that way, there's no way I could say no...”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Thanks! I owe you one!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Shino happily clasps Hotori by the hands.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you to use that pretty mouth of yours to satisfy all those disgusting pigs in the industry group!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Er, what was the job again...?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Singing, what else?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Just singing, right?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I would never get my little pride and joy involved with any indecent work.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Anyways, I'll get back to you once we've got all the details ironed out.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Standing on the roof of the Government-General, I look up at the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"The time I spent at Miyoshi feels almost like a dream as I think back on what happened.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(What a worthwhile dinner that was...)”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"My apologies to Sarashina-san, but the part of the evening that really made an impression on me was my discussion with Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"As a fellow soldier, I just might have a lot to learn from how the warriors choose to live.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"─Fealty, huh?",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if that's true, I'd still consider it worse to lose my composure and show hesitation on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Standing upon that hallowed ground where people put their very lives on their line, I absolutely want to know what it is I'm fighting to protect.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I need to know what it is I'm laying down my life for.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As a soldier, do you think you're truly capable of fighting without hesitation?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"His question catches me off guard, and I sit up a little straighter.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have no hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I fight for the sake of all those who suffer under tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Fighting to liberate people from tyranny, huh?",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"I know full well that that's just a pretext.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"It's plainly evident that the Republic wages war with much more impure motives.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"─Those indiscriminate carpet bombings the other day.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"─That field test of experimental ordinances last week.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"─The brutal reprisal campaigns against enemy partisans.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"All of it was done to line the pockets of some fat cat sitting in a cozy chair somewhere back on the mainland.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"And of course, nothing ever comes to the people risking their lives on the front lines.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Honestly, what am I even fighting for?",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"What did all my fallen comrades die for?",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"...I've been at a loss ever since the day I saw my father's true face.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"I was only able to throw off this hesitation once I accepted my mission to administer this country.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"My father, Warren, clearly has no intentions of bringing democracy to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Just like all the other countries we occupy, his designs only go as far as sucking the country dry, sparing not a single thought for the people on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"And so, I decided to devote myself to actually living up to our ideological imperative.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"─Bring democracy, peace, and prosperity to every corner of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"─Remake this country from the ground up such that in ten\nyears' time, the Imperials will be thanking us for our takeover.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"These ideals became my new goal.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"I wouldn't be able to deny it if someone called it out as a childish act of rebellion to spite my father.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Even so, I want to get back at those rotten-to-the-core elites by naïvely holding up the shining ideals they all trample underfoot.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"I know that I'm not doing this with the Imperial people in mind. I know that it's all for my own petty self-satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"But even so, I want to deny the Republic the satisfaction of adding another vassal state to its collection.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"That was how I'd thought up until today, but the more I talked with Tokita-kun, the more I realized just how weak I really am.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I envy Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"His tenacious expression, free from all hesitation, floats to the surface of my mind.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I caught a glimpse of that same expression back when we fought at the warehouse beside the river.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"From his point of view, the situation must have seemed utterly hopeless, but he still wielded his blade without any hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I'd thought that he simply didn't value his own life, but after our conversation tonight, I now realize how wrong I was.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"He understood what he truly needed to protect, and in doing so, he erased the hesitation from his heart.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Next to his resolve, the goals I've set for myself are just as they seem: an immature and petty act of spite.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Without an unshakeable ideal to cling to, a conviction that surges up from the depths of my own heart, I won't ever be able to fight like Tokita-kun does.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want to be like Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I'm immediately brought back to my senses once I realize what I just involuntarily whispered aloud.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"I check my surroundings in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Phew, nobody in sight who might have overheard.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Wanting to be like him? What's wrong with me!?",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"I must be imagining things. The warriors are our ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"enemy.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"These feelings are nothing more than professional respect for his conduct as a soldier.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Yeah! That's right!",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"I slap myself on the cheeks to convince myself.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
